 "selection_disclosure": "both the ship-list and PROBA_FLOOR were chosen on these same 400 out-of-fold predictions. The predictions are honest -- no model saw its own record -- but the THRESHOLDS are fitted to this sample, so the per-class F1 is optimistic as an estimate of a fresh sample by an unmeasured amount. The 25% holdout does not fix this: it is a split of the same 400 records, not an independent sample. Only new hand labels would settle it.",
